\section{Experimental Setup}
Datasets: Facebook Page-Page, LastFM Asia, GitHub Social. Equal edge-retention budgets. Leakage protocol in \texttt{docs/leakage\_audit.md}.

\section{Results}
\subsection{Multi-seed LastFM (seeds 0--9; budgets 0.1--0.9)}
Equal edge-removal budgets; GCN downstream; fusion fixed to concatenation for CAILP multi vs A31.
Adversarial learning is excluded from the core comparison (pilot negative; Macro-F1 $0.666$ vs core $0.829$ at 50\% removal).

\begin{center}
\small
\begin{tabular}{lcccc}
\toprule
Method & 30\% & 50\% & 70\% & AUC \\
\midrule
PTDNet & $0.795{\pm}0.025$ & $0.788{\pm}0.013$ & $0.760{\pm}0.018$ & $0.616{\pm}0.012$ \\
CAILP multi-obj & $0.786{\pm}0.040$ & $0.769{\pm}0.061$ & $0.715{\pm}0.071$ & $0.593{\pm}0.038$ \\
Original ILP-GCN & $0.801{\pm}0.019$ & $0.776{\pm}0.023$ & $0.702{\pm}0.032$ & $0.590{\pm}0.017$ \\
Random & $0.773{\pm}0.016$ & $0.745{\pm}0.036$ & $0.696{\pm}0.036$ & $0.580{\pm}0.018$ \\
A31 fidelity-only & $0.758{\pm}0.062$ & $0.730{\pm}0.083$ & $0.673{\pm}0.081$ & $0.566{\pm}0.050$ \\
NeuralSparse & $0.665{\pm}0.022$ & $0.602{\pm}0.013$ & $0.551{\pm}0.021$ & $0.489{\pm}0.010$ \\
DSpar / ER proxy & $0.613{\pm}0.031$ & $0.558{\pm}0.027$ & $0.524{\pm}0.020$ & $0.458{\pm}0.014$ \\
\bottomrule
\end{tabular}
\end{center}

Surrogate ranking quality is higher for the multi-objective teacher (Spearman $\approx 0.78$) than for A31 ($\approx 0.32$).
RQ11 headline retention still requires consistent gains on $\geq 2$ datasets; Facebook/GitHub grids are in progress.

\subsection{Facebook diagnostic (teacher size)}
A reduced teacher ($n{=}40$) explained the earlier negative Facebook pilot.
Validation-selected $n{=}120$ raises test Macro-F1 at 50\% removal from $0.906$ to $0.938$.
The unfavorable pilot result is retained in the record.

\subsection{Track B}
Node-sampling results remain separate from edge-retention percentages.


\section{Ablation and Sensitivity Analysis}
A31 executed on LastFM. Further ablations (fusion, uncertainty, mass priors, adversarial) are scripted (\texttt{scripts/run\_ablation.py}, \texttt{run\_sensitivity.py}, \texttt{run\_adversarial\_variants.py}).

\section{Discussion}
Pending fuller runs. Pilot suggests the ILP extension is operational on social graphs; architectural and multi-objective claims remain evidence-gated.

\section{Limitations}
Counterfactual teacher cost; lightweight structural features in the CAILP training path for scalability; CPU-only runs in this environment; multi-hot features differ from historical 128-d PyG \texttt{.npz} hosts (unavailable); line-graph path auto-disabled on larger edge sets; DSpar and effective-resistance currently share one resistance-style proxy implementation; full Facebook/GitHub multi-seed grids and complete A1--A32 tables were still expanding at draft time.
